                                "sense_id": "c903517a-7c0a-35bd-98cc-e7cec7bf743e",
                                "text": "At the micro level he was a good manager. At the macro level he failed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccc2ef45-bf85-4565-9f8b-9ec9d635659f",
                                "sense_id": "c903517a-7c0a-35bd-98cc-e7cec7bf743e",
                                "text": "Financial independence and micro retirement have come to represent the autonomy I've created for myself, which is a powerful feeling."
